  "interpretation": "The population-level cancellation diagnosis survives three explicit confounder checks. Collapsing duplicate physical atoms leaves 58 unique points and changes the cancellation-scale/discrepancy Spearman coefficient only from -0.5341 to -0.5164. DES alone retains rho about -0.508, so the association is not generated by the repeated BOSS_GL64 atoms. The lowest-cancellation-scale quartile contains 13/16 strict-threshold exceedances versus 1/16 in each of the two highest-scale quartiles, and the median cancellation scale of >=1e-3 atoms is only 0.1348 times that of <1e-3 atoms. This materially strengthens finite-difference cancellation amplification as a distributed numerical-conditioning diagnosis. It remains support-only +0/+0 and does not change the frozen scientific convergence gate, authorize 32769, authorize covariance restriction, or open Wm_S3."
